      "writtenOn": "2026-08-31T10:07:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure. I have updated change 46587 [1] with a test case that exercises `pool-\u003eremaining`, by creating a pool with more than 13 IPs and sending traffic that is expected to match against all IPs in the NAT\u0027d pool (We currently use the logic (source_ip % pool_size) to map source IPs to the NAT\u0027d IPs).\n\n[1] https://gerrit.fd.io/r/c/vpp/+/46587",
      "parentUuid": "81d884cb_60da4b15",
      "revId": "8149a8cc1384121ca91e0661e72623842ab8fc4b",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
